pi/system-prompt/defaults/voice.md
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The output-shape rule set is adapted from i-have-adhd
(https://github.com/ayghri/i-have-adhd). The prose is rewritten and the rule set
is modified — upstream's time-estimate and destructive-action-confirmation rules
are deliberately omitted — but the rules, their sequence, and the enumerated
opener and closer lists derive from that work.

